            "sid": "EZK 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani ifsaani bibiliqu, ka aka Waaqi Israeli arti jiru garsiisu kaani, waan lubbu qaba ka koola kaani fulla qara jiru taani iraa kae, gara balbala Mana Waaqaa deeme. AABBO Waaqi namicha woya boofta keeyatu kaani yaame waan jed'eeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
